    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Asset records in Active status with no AssetStatePeriod child records.
Why it matters: Asset has no state history — billing schedule, lifecycle events, and amendment logic all depend on state periods. Missing periods cause silent billing failures.
Suppress a finding: during a documented data migration window.
Disable the detector: leave on.</value></values>
